{
  "schema": 1,
  "id": "override-toggle-bot",
  "name": "Override: Toggle control bot",
  "description": "A zoning robot: a front roller at Toggle height (port 8) that spins a Toggle either way, an optical sensor (port 9) that sees the Toggle face in front of the roller, and a rear fold-out plate (ADI B) that presses a Toggle one face per push. No game-piece manipulators. A pneumatic C-channel jammer (ADI C) beside the roller wedges a Toggle so it cannot turn; it must let go before the end, or the Toggle counts as neutral.",
